{"2026.5.8:P01-Q03":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>胶体制备燃料电池与滴定装置</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题3 · P01-Q03</div><h1>胶体制备燃料电池与滴定装置</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学实验基础/探究性实验/化学实验方案的设计与评价</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：评价装置反应原理、氨气干燥和氧化还原滴定干扰。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的分类及转化/分散系及其分类</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学电源</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/电解池</span><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/常见物质的制备/常见气体的制备与收集</span><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/物质检验与物质含量的测定/物质含量的测定/氧化还原原理滴定</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>3. 下列实验装置能达到相应实验目的的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:206b0ba00085ddcbc79e548795e04c728d1ef2a573873c69d29f472b3a019a03:0;\" style=\"width:550.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 图①装置用于制备<img src=\"chem-asset:7631fccdbb122bdf413bcbbf1152d69194241b7ae056f9253a9222bd5f57699a:1;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">胶体</p><p>B. 图②装置用于制作简易氢氧燃料电池</p><p>C. 图③装置用于制备干燥的氨气</p><p>D. 图④装置用于测定<img src=\"chem-asset:f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4:2;\" style=\"width:41.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中铁的质量分数</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．制备<img src=\"chem-asset:b637bda8aee3df659c27feb98c9088d7cf4f841458f2790e0df0835adcc8b111:3;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​胶体的正确方法是将饱和<img src=\"chem-asset:8a387208e9d4a27ea4d52ff2446857996fbac9c9c632e2f517b1cce122c262f9:4;\" style=\"width:41.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​溶液逐滴加入沸水中，继续加热至体系变为红褐色；该装置直接加热<img src=\"chem-asset:8a387208e9d4a27ea4d52ff2446857996fbac9c9c632e2f517b1cce122c262f9:4;\" style=\"width:41.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​的水溶液，无法制得<img src=\"chem-asset:b637bda8aee3df659c27feb98c9088d7cf4f841458f2790e0df0835adcc8b111:3;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​胶体，A错误；</p><p>B．闭合<img src=\"chem-asset:33bdfa87ea1a441182b910e66422a6df290b4c3b2019ec105aa3e0cbd8255995:5;\" style=\"width:20.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​、断开<img src=\"chem-asset:9b2404ccf4b30480749468aec1a549b26c80d7f3137ff94ec580ef808910f7a6:6;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​时，电解滴有酚酞的<img src=\"chem-asset:32c4cd749e353985ba8d5c91fc81a0dee8c55a1520d67fd67f213f61de004b60:7;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，阳极（接电源正极的石墨）产生<img src=\"chem-asset:b85cfa964ed474795563491595bb69cf4e97b9ebd726e13c5272e9aa9d520cac:8;\" style=\"width:21.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，阴极（接电源负极的石墨）产生<img src=\"chem-asset:826df31e191fd74de775e57ce0bd0eadff4459f5015c97d2b982206a873c9c32:9;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​，两种气体吸附在石墨电极上；断开<img src=\"chem-asset:33bdfa87ea1a441182b910e66422a6df290b4c3b2019ec105aa3e0cbd8255995:5;\" style=\"width:20.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、闭合<img src=\"chem-asset:9b2404ccf4b30480749468aec1a549b26c80d7f3137ff94ec580ef808910f7a6:6;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">后，吸附了<img src=\"chem-asset:826df31e191fd74de775e57ce0bd0eadff4459f5015c97d2b982206a873c9c32:9;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:b85cfa964ed474795563491595bb69cf4e97b9ebd726e13c5272e9aa9d520cac:8;\" style=\"width:21.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​的电极在电解质溶液中形成原电池，即可作为简易氢氧燃料电池，能达到实验目的，B正确；</p><p>C．氯化钙会与氨气反应生成八氨合氯化钙<img src=\"chem-asset:e50e50098d0e2999e2d5504f6b5be9ea3598351983dbcc5e721fe148bd4ed870:10;\" style=\"width:88.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，会吸收氨气，不能用<img src=\"chem-asset:5e674a1fdb4e301c58573e3f78150ed8c3ed9ad2500877d48a251f629c509fad:11;\" style=\"width:42.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">干燥氨气，C错误；</p><p>D．酸性<img src=\"chem-asset:86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5:12;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">不仅氧化<img src=\"chem-asset:f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2:13;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，还会氧化<img src=\"chem-asset:8cc2a11bebba83fe8d6499c831900e9142ca6d43fd7ccc63f450c2187cfd594f:14;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，会额外消耗<img src=\"chem-asset:86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5:12;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">标准液，导致测定结果误差偏大，无法准确测定<img src=\"chem-asset:f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4:15;\" style=\"width:41.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中铁的质量分数，D错误；</p><p>故答案选B。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["206b0ba00085ddcbc79e548795e04c728d1ef2a573873c69d29f472b3a019a03","32c4cd749e353985ba8d5c91fc81a0dee8c55a1520d67fd67f213f61de004b60","33bdfa87ea1a441182b910e66422a6df290b4c3b2019ec105aa3e0cbd8255995","5e674a1fdb4e301c58573e3f78150ed8c3ed9ad2500877d48a251f629c509fad","7631fccdbb122bdf413bcbbf1152d69194241b7ae056f9253a9222bd5f57699a","826df31e191fd74de775e57ce0bd0eadff4459f5015c97d2b982206a873c9c32","86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5","8a387208e9d4a27ea4d52ff2446857996fbac9c9c632e2f517b1cce122c262f9","8cc2a11bebba83fe8d6499c831900e9142ca6d43fd7ccc63f450c2187cfd594f","9b2404ccf4b30480749468aec1a549b26c80d7f3137ff94ec580ef808910f7a6","b637bda8aee3df659c27feb98c9088d7cf4f841458f2790e0df0835adcc8b111","b85cfa964ed474795563491595bb69cf4e97b9ebd726e13c5272e9aa9d520cac","e50e50098d0e2999e2d5504f6b5be9ea3598351983dbcc5e721fe148bd4ed870","f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4","f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2"],"refs":{"chem-asset:206b0ba00085ddcbc79e548795e04c728d1ef2a573873c69d29f472b3a019a03:0;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/206b0ba00085ddcbc79e5487.png","chem-asset:7631fccdbb122bdf413bcbbf1152d69194241b7ae056f9253a9222bd5f57699a:1;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7ea0d90c8d2ad0c7e2d4a364.png","chem-asset:f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4:2;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/5a4cd4a30e0fc6ae616a13c1.png","chem-asset:b637bda8aee3df659c27feb98c9088d7cf4f841458f2790e0df0835adcc8b111:3;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/20649f51b757d348bbe9f4c9.png","chem-asset:8a387208e9d4a27ea4d52ff2446857996fbac9c9c632e2f517b1cce122c262f9:4;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/6b3644133a5133d66a73c155.png","chem-asset:33bdfa87ea1a441182b910e66422a6df290b4c3b2019ec105aa3e0cbd8255995:5;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/fe6c3ae67f54f5aa2187ad7b.png","chem-asset:9b2404ccf4b30480749468aec1a549b26c80d7f3137ff94ec580ef808910f7a6:6;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/51c65924e99d7c8173f33ff9.png","chem-asset:32c4cd749e353985ba8d5c91fc81a0dee8c55a1520d67fd67f213f61de004b60:7;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/8a16a160116e20058e3b36b2.png","chem-asset:b85cfa964ed474795563491595bb69cf4e97b9ebd726e13c5272e9aa9d520cac:8;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/835a9cfa8621301c71440fa8.png","chem-asset:826df31e191fd74de775e57ce0bd0eadff4459f5015c97d2b982206a873c9c32:9;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/1d5334478a29d827309bf9da.png","chem-asset:e50e50098d0e2999e2d5504f6b5be9ea3598351983dbcc5e721fe148bd4ed870:10;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/74457e43f1a7375e5d549389.png","chem-asset:5e674a1fdb4e301c58573e3f78150ed8c3ed9ad2500877d48a251f629c509fad:11;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7f9ff8153aff47c5dc47cbd4.png","chem-asset:86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5:12;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/5763d25abcb5235c70197b3d.png","chem-asset:f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2:13;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/82d4df1e231639c41f152d34.png","chem-asset:8cc2a11bebba83fe8d6499c831900e9142ca6d43fd7ccc63f450c2187cfd594f:14;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c5b362a361398d7e3b3f8525.png","chem-asset:f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4:15;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/9544fde8c70e01f5702d6679.png"},"sourceSha256":"190acb1b5bce5bbf89e34cda56d06a9fd05648c86f05d9127d6e0d25b949dada","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学实验基础/探究性实验/化学实验方案的设计与评价/2026.5.8/P01-Q03_胶体制备燃料电池与滴定装置.html"},"2026.5.8:P02-Q08":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>臭氧磷三键与邻羟基苯甲酸</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 麓山国际四月学情调研 · 原题8 · P02-Q08</div><h1>臭氧磷三键与邻羟基苯甲酸</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/分子的性质</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：从极性、轨道重叠、竞争配位和分子内氢键解释性质。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/化学键/共价键</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/分子间作用力</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/电离平衡常数和电离度</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/酚类</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;\" style=\"width:434.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>8. 结构决定性质，性质决定用途。有关下列事实的解释错误的是</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>事实</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>解释</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>A</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:255d08ae37bef33bce05b003ad8cfb98aa37b4aeeb82a57a8eb57b4ad5bb1184:1;\" style=\"width:20.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">在<img src=\"chem-asset:7db70008dedf8ce593b5a71653cc8a5aa228deefd2af620fb10a7ef87b77e172:2;\" style=\"width:36.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中的溶解度高于在水中的溶解度</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:255d08ae37bef33bce05b003ad8cfb98aa37b4aeeb82a57a8eb57b4ad5bb1184:1;\" style=\"width:20.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">是非极性分子，相似相溶</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>B</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>稳定性：<img src=\"chem-asset:5c2e040e9ae702166a861e23c2e045ca695ededcc2b6aa98a2f90cbe67b3a0a6:3;\" style=\"width:53.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(极不稳定)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>磷原子半径大，磷磷之间难以形成三键</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>C</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>向含<img src=\"chem-asset:d1e958f0e4fe85b0b633f211f1185f1f6d8fea46dbda139ec24e1a0b4076122a:4;\" style=\"width:101.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的溶液中滴加稀硫酸，<img src=\"chem-asset:d1e958f0e4fe85b0b633f211f1185f1f6d8fea46dbda139ec24e1a0b4076122a:4;\" style=\"width:101.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">变成<img src=\"chem-asset:aa397344ee775ed61bcdd30f0531c01e8f74f5012bb0358a195f3dc13979f198:5;\" style=\"width:100.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>与<img src=\"chem-asset:7d3e687e0e448750e852f60f2d03346591953739ff61ebd8d4ded703cce0471a:6;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">形成配位键的能力：<img src=\"chem-asset:844b2d996300406103bdce0d4dd7d2a605ce8ef0815e324fa8c030a9a2c94c81:7;\" style=\"width:70.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>D</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>酸性：<img src=\"chem-asset:915c173314effd184af7702565e55288204da93a26716f0fbf38037854b0788b:8;\" style=\"width:26.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(邻羟基苯甲酸)<img src=\"chem-asset:c140d8a1e65a715f83aee1b92965d09ed6efa39c5d09e014c8a59e19f668b57a:9;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(苯酚)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>邻羟基苯甲酸根能形成分子内氢键</p></td></tr></table></div><p>A. A　B. B　C. C　D. D</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】A</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．O<sub>3</sub>是由非极性键构成的极性分子，但极性微弱，因此在四氯化碳中溶解度更大，A错误；</p><p>B．磷原子半径较大，p轨道重叠效果差，难以形成稳定的<img src=\"chem-asset:e0246097fa27b1dc0481f04ff74f3c30868458bdd22869daf6c02b0fb0f77d03:10;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">三键，因此<img src=\"chem-asset:49ace24d647377f279449dffe055503ccd4c25b119e444a92fdf86233ec86eef:11;\" style=\"width:17.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">极不稳定，而<img src=\"chem-asset:ad412953ce247a3e42fb706abde7c77ad7913f33fea5acc4773d85a6756d3dbd:12;\" style=\"width:22.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">稳定，解释合理，B正确；</p><p>C．在<img src=\"chem-asset:35557f07d2370490b2df6ab29d7fef9b859fb4cdfa214c8fb6c1d9acf4efd4cd:13;\" style=\"width:101.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中滴入<img src=\"chem-asset:aad1c7653a3a3edda2d8b1be4bb810421e5cf6f94ab1265aaf8e6f2a5e152334:14;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">生成<img src=\"chem-asset:cd4f5133d187dbe9105d507c0b89563adf7bfc2c66c0e6197a52cd26004d4261:15;\" style=\"width:100.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，该过程中<img src=\"chem-asset:7d3e687e0e448750e852f60f2d03346591953739ff61ebd8d4ded703cce0471a:6;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:16;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的配位键断裂，<img src=\"chem-asset:7d3e687e0e448750e852f60f2d03346591953739ff61ebd8d4ded703cce0471a:6;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:97ee0d52cecb1b6546b838426ebc3b237a012b28280d0efb7938b941b8b4f4a9:17;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">结合成<img src=\"chem-asset:4f5f60fd5572e9e0497b4ab818120820f193aba51ed8751c47b527d77cbf1cab:18;\" style=\"width:35.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，说明<img src=\"chem-asset:97ee0d52cecb1b6546b838426ebc3b237a012b28280d0efb7938b941b8b4f4a9:17;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:7d3e687e0e448750e852f60f2d03346591953739ff61ebd8d4ded703cce0471a:6;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的结合能力强于<img src=\"chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:16;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即与<img src=\"chem-asset:7d3e687e0e448750e852f60f2d03346591953739ff61ebd8d4ded703cce0471a:6;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">形成配位键的能力：<img src=\"chem-asset:40c5ad238d087e5d43f3fc4cf3aa45ad95a2e3684e0fc41015b96e6020811ac0:19;\" style=\"width:70.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C正确；</p><p>D．邻羟基苯甲酸根离子中，邻位羧酸根与酚羟基形成分子内氢键，使结构更稳定，导致酚羟基更难电离，因此其<img src=\"chem-asset:e984959a22d49c03558400f4bbefb44360d6719d85be7e90dfe3129fa4a98a35:20;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(酚羟基电离常数)小于苯酚的<img src=\"chem-asset:2769e806b2ef17415b9a90f656aa47a8ef2fbfb9887b2fc736f7ea7202cd4098:21;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，解释合理，D正确；</p><p>故答案选A。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["255d08ae37bef33bce05b003ad8cfb98aa37b4aeeb82a57a8eb57b4ad5bb1184","2769e806b2ef17415b9a90f656aa47a8ef2fbfb9887b2fc736f7ea7202cd4098","35557f07d2370490b2df6ab29d7fef9b859fb4cdfa214c8fb6c1d9acf4efd4cd","40c5ad238d087e5d43f3fc4cf3aa45ad95a2e